{"formal_ids": ["GS-770"], "labels": ["周期函数", "定积分不等式", "泰勒公式", "积分区间平移", "绝对值不等式"], "metadata": {"capture_ids": ["MFI-CAP-7f7e536cd1a7b2d01a8f66ff"], "closeout_id": "MFI-CLOSE-47bb5409c99c7ae4164b2d5b", "conversation_complete": true, "coverage": "full_bytes", "files": [{"path": "/Users/xiazhibin/Documents/kaoyan-math/数学一回滚复习系统/快速入库来源/2026-08-31/MATHPKG-14f032d2ecb59e5370c13c6a/conversation.json", "sha256": "0da68cba60d1bb685b94d9b6858d0c65cf477b2c1e090e8360ade53e751fe224", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}, {"path": "/Users/xiazhibin/Documents/kaoyan-math/数学一回滚复习系统/快速入库来源/2026-08-31/MATHPKG-14f032d2ecb59e5370c13c6a/source.json", "sha256": "fe21caf5583298875f3aa184cf5b77f2b1cfe0657bab755fab4ecf6722dfcc46", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}, {"path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-08-31/MATHPKG-14f032d2ecb59e5370c13c6a/attachments/explanation_image_01.png", "sha256": "09c04308d564bd74e6c12c86f60d9502f0ac9a8d957ff70b2f44b8a61652aa7c", "status": "verified", "text_status": "text_unavailable_no_ocr"}, {"path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-08-31/MATHPKG-14f032d2ecb59e5370c13c6a/attachments/question_image_01.png", "sha256": "9a7ddd406917dab90ee146b005c457adc2a844b63241458d0ba7df759f0905ba", "status": "verified", "text_status": "text_unavailable_no_ocr"}, {"path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-08-31/MATHPKG-14f032d2ecb59e5370c13c6a/attachments/user_work_image_01.png", "sha256": "fa0ca5433f9d7282e3ebe76ce5e811fb5d5cf464a3f7050e8432f4aa0af92628", "status": "verified", "text_status": "text_unavailable_no_ocr"}], "original_path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-08-31/MATHPKG-14f032d2ecb59e5370c13c6a", "original_sha256": "3f2097cb842d1996a97f015b2f1225821770afc429f7e77a0906331fea2545fc", "personal_evidence": false, "receipt_id": "MATH-ARCHIVE-a048a73eca4243f610b1bd12", "role": "raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause", "selected_user_sequence": 1, "selection": "first_complete_user_turn", "status": "verified", "terminal_outcomes": ["wrong_recorded"], "user_turn_cache": "错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/02437b276ab63321c2a59dfa1a297f9be448297bec09c9009122e9f491514454.users.json", "user_turn_cache_sha256": "02437b276ab63321c2a59dfa1a297f9be448297bec09c9009122e9f491514454", "user_turn_count": 2, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 473], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "9bc6f3a4f4f4838223e6a22f389e9fddb74c3c5d9a38f4a006961b8bbb0352a7", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 207], "next_role": null, "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "6f27d034903b8259cbf6a2b1b43e494e48ff4096a97876e2983ae27501882198", "role": "user", "sequence": 3}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "这道题第一问倒是没什么问题，直接用公式做就行。\n\n重点是第二问。我看答案没有用到第一问的结论，但在我印象中，这种题一般第二问都会用到第一问的结论。你看第二问能不能用第一问的结论去做？我看答案确实用过类似的方法，你帮我看看第二问到底该怎么做，我思路卡在哪了，有哪些条件是我没注意到的？\n\n我的推导过程是这样的：\n我把 f(x) 在 x = 0 处做泰勒展开：f(x) = f(0) + f'(0)x + 1/2 f''(ξ)x²。\n\n然后对它在 [0, M] 上积分，即 ∫[0 to M] f(x)dx ≤ f(0)M + f'(0) · (M²/2) + M³/6。\n\n因为 M 是正整数，所以 M³ ≥ M，由此可以推得它小于等于 f(0)M + f'(0) · (M/2) + M/6。\n\n照这样推下去，只要令 f'(0) · (M/2) ≤ 0（或者等于 0），我就可以求出题目里的第二个等式了。因为 M/2 > 0，所以我只要证出 f'(0) ≤ 0 就行。\n\n但这步 f'(0) ≤ 0 到底要怎么证？我完全证不出来，不知道该怎么做了"}